        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "This is a worthwhile read. If I may add one point, products manufactured in the United States now command a premium. AAOI has said that U.S.-made optical modules carry a premium, and U.S. hyperscalers will also be willing to pay a premium for Micron’s U.S.-made DRAM.  Korean",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090045731864539387",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-19T19:58:28.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 521
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Taiwan's DigiTimes reports that Nvidia's Feynman platform, the generation after next, will move straight to A16, TSMC's upgraded version of its 2nm process, and will also raise the share of SoIC 3D stacking, with custom HBM and CPO expected to be combined on top of that.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2088061698473410965",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-14T08:34:37.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 434
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Nvidia’s next generation chip platform, Feynman is ahead of schedule, will use TSMC’s A16 process, and CPO (co-packaged optics), DigiTimes reports, with TSMC full speed ahead to meet 2028 mass production.  -Nvidia is rapidly shifting its supply chain to put Feynman out in the 2nd",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2088070401943601341",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-14T09:09:12.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 308
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Prices of Indium Phosphide (InP) substrates and epi-wafers are set to jump over 10% in the 4th quarter – the biggest price hike in history – as the AI-driven optical communications boom causes severe shortages, media report.   One supplier reportedly said inventory is so tight",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2089145940720681012",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-17T08:23:01.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 269
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "NPO presents an interim solution under the transition from pluggable to true CPO. NPO has certain benefits over CPO that bypass current production and reliability challenge of CPO, while maintaining most of the benefits CPO provide.  Pros:   Better serviceability (field",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2086860579415761313",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T01:01:48.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 220
        },
        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "TPU is working with the popular OSS inference optimization library Mooncake on integrating TPU with Mooncake Store. Similar to NVL72, KVCache DRAM P2P pooling will initially happen on the scale-out network via TENT instead of using ICI/NVLink.  Mooncake basically improves",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2090197436614557797",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-20T06:01:17.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 190
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "When Nvidia announced Spectrum-X switches built with CPO (co-packaged optics) have entered mass production, it named 4 Taiwan firms among partners, TSMC, Foxconn, ASE and Browave as well as China’s leading optics firm, TFC Communication, media report, and multiple firms say their",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2089507692541104604",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-18T08:20:29.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 156
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "NVIDIA is accelerating the rollout of the Feynman new platform in the second half of 2028, skipping Rubin to directly adopt TSMC's A16 process (2nm upgrade), SoIC 3D stacking technology, customized HBM, and CPO.  Feynman will advance toward 3D small chips and CPO development,",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2088150124317061550",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-14T14:26:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 127
